37161>>>>>    Function SetUserPassword String sLoginName String sPassword Returns Boolean
37163>>>>>        Handle hoUserDD
37163>>>>>        Integer iErr
37163>>>>>        Get phoUserDD to hoUserDD
37164>>>>>        
37164>>>>>        //  Find the user
37164>>>>>        Send Clear of hoUserDD
37165>>>>>        Move sLoginName to WebAppUser.LoginName
37166>>>>>        Send Find of hoUserDD EQ Index.1
37167>>>>>        If (not(Found)) Begin
37169>>>>>            Send Clear of hoUserDD
37170>>>>>            Function_Return False
37171>>>>>        End
37171>>>>>>
37171>>>>>        
37171>>>>>        If (not(CreatePasswordHash(Self, Trim(sPassword), &sPassword))) Begin
37173>>>>>            Send Clear of hoUserDD
37174>>>>>            Function_Return False
37175>>>>>        End
37175>>>>>>
37175>>>>>        Set Field_Changed_Value of hoUserDD Field WebAppUser.Password to sPassword
37176>>>>>        Get Request_Validate of hoUserDD to iErr
37177>>>>>        If (iErr) Begin
37179>>>>>            Send Clear of hoUserDD
37180>>>>>            Function_Return False
37181>>>>>        End
37181>>>>>>
37181>>>>>        
37181>>>>>        Send Request_Save of hoUserDD
37182>>>>>        Function_Return (not(Err))
