37195>>>>>    
37195>>>>>    //
37195>>>>>    // This procedure is called when validating a session and after logging in. Its purpose is to 
37195>>>>>    // update properties based on the session and user data. Augment this function to update 
37195>>>>>    // properties based on the session / user table. Note that WebAppUser and WebAppSession contain
37195>>>>>    // the right records when this procedure is called.
37195>>>>>    //
37195>>>>>    // Params:
37195>>>>>    //      bClear   True if the procedure is called before session validation to clear properties.
37195>>>>>    //
37195>>>>>    Procedure UpdateSessionProperties Boolean bClear
37197>>>>>        Handle hoUserDD
37197>>>>>        
37197>>>>>        Get phoUserDD to hoUserDD
37198>>>>>        
37198>>>>>        //  Update user properties
37198>>>>>        If (not(bClear) and HasRecord(hoUserDD)) Begin
37200>>>>>            Set psUsername to (Trim(WebAppUser.FullName))
37201>>>>>            Set psLoginName to (Trim(WebAppUser.LoginName))
37202>>>>>            Set piUserRights to WebAppUser.Rights
37203>>>>>            
37203>>>>>            Send OnSessionPropertiesSet 
37204>>>>>        End
37204>>>>>>
37204>>>>>        Else Begin
37205>>>>>            Set psUsername to ""
37206>>>>>            Set psLoginName to ""
37207>>>>>            Set piUserRights to 0
37208>>>>>            
37208>>>>>            Send OnSessionPropertiesClear
37209>>>>>        End
37209>>>>>>
37209>>>>>    End_Procedure
37210>>>>>    
37210>>>>>    Procedure OnSessionPropertiesSet
37212>>>>>        //  Empty event stub
37212>>>>>    End_Procedure
37213>>>>>    
37213>>>>>    Procedure OnSessionPropertiesClear
37215>>>>>        //  Empty event stub
37215>>>>>    End_Procedure
37216>>>>>    
37216>>>>>    Procedure EndSession
37218>>>>>        Integer iErr
37218>>>>>        Boolean bLogWebSession
37218>>>>>        Handle hoSessionDD       
37218>>>>>        
37218>>>>>        Get phoSessionDD to hoSessionDD
37219>>>>>        Get pbLogWebSession to bLogWebSession
37220>>>>>        If not bLogWebSession Begin
37222>>>>>            Forward Send EndSession
37224>>>>>            Procedure_Return
37225>>>>>        End
37225>>>>>>
37225>>>>>            
37225>>>>>        //  Check if session exists
37225>>>>>        Send Clear of hoSessionDD
37226>>>>>        Get psSessionKey to WebAppSession.SessionKey
37227>>>>>        
37227>>>>>        Send Find of hoSessionDD EQ Index.1
37228>>>>>        If (Found) Begin
37230>>>>>            Set Field_Changed_Value of hoSessionDD Field WebAppSession.Active to "N"
37231>>>>>            Get Request_Validate of hoSessionDD to iErr
37232>>>>>            If (iErr) Begin
37234>>>>>                // this should not happen. If it does its a programming error
37234>>>>>                Error DFERR_PROGRAM C_$WebAppSessionValidateFailed
37235>>>>>>
37235>>>>>                Procedure_Return
37236>>>>>            End
37236>>>>>>
37236>>>>>            Send Request_Save of hoSessionDD
37237>>>>>        End
37237>>>>>>
37237>>>>>    End_Procedure
37238>>>>>
37238>>>>>End_Class
